  .banner-hero.banner-breadcrums
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-7
          h1.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-20 Academic Assessment Report (Student Outcomes)
          p.text-body-text.color-gray-500 Nazarene Bible College annually assesses the effectiveness of its academic programs. A report of the annual academic assessment process is accessible below.
        .col-lg-5.d-flex.justify-content-evenly.align-items-center
